WEBVTT

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.020
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.400
"I'm going to become a ghost."

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:24.610
Being a ghost is good.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.160
Wow! It's a moving heart!

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.130
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:17.980
<i>I'm seriously sick of cram school.</i>

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:19.980
<i>"Ugh."</i>

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:22.130
-<i>"It's summer break."</i>
-<i>"I don't wanna go."</i>

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:26.030
<i>I wish that teacher would
die in an accident.</i>

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:27.610
<i>Better yet...</i>

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.550
<i>I wanna kill him.</i>

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:30.280
<i>"Kill the teacher. LOL"</i>

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:31.430
-<i>"My hero."</i>
-<i>"You're a god. LOL"</i>

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.260
CHAPTER 19

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:55.280
<i>YOKAI</i> RESURRECTION?! THE GHOST SCHOOL

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:59.190
Did you hear?
Apparently there's a ghost school.

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:00.250
Huh?

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.820
How old are you?

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:06.240
It's not me. There's a rumor
going around at Hiroto's school.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.110
Oh. An elementary school rumor, huh?

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:12.590
They say if you go to that school,
you can become a ghost.

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:16.960
If you're a ghost,
you can slumber in bed in the morning

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.850
and there's no tests.

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:22.350
What are you, stupid?
You just don't want to study.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.710
It's summer break
and we're going to cram school.

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:28.230
Yeah, I'd like to be a ghost...

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:22.730
Dad, it's a letter from Mana.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:25.650
WEARING SCARY MASK

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:25.710
Do you know any <i>yokai</i> like this?

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:29.210
Hmm... I don't know.

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.590
She says it disappeared
without doing anything.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:39.600
Perhaps Mana-chan's more approachable
to <i>yokai</i> now because of our influence.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.370
I guess so.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:45.080
Dad.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:48.560
A ghost school?

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.500
It's Mana-chan!

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:13.920
What's wrong?

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.070
Yuta-kun?

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.910
Hiroto-kun, went away.

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:27.060
On RAIN he said,
"I'm going to become a ghost."

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:32.360
What? Explain it to me.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.340
Hiroto said he's becoming a ghost?

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:35.800
About that...

00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:39.660
Could you fill me in on it, too?

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:45.980
I've gotten a bunch of letters from people
saying their friends have disappeared.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:51.400
Well, if you go to the graves
on 3rd Street at 3:00 AM and say,

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:55.530
<i>"Sanmaidara Nagidara
Moujya no yokone ni kimo tsuita"</i>

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:59.080
three times, 4th Street appears.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.930
It's nearly time.

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:04.430
But, do you think
there's really a 4th Street?

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.670
This town only has up to 3rd Street.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.040
We'll just have to try it.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:18.090
<i>Sanmaidara Nagidara
Moujya no yokone ni kimo tsuita</i>

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:24.060
<i>Sanmaidara Nagidara
Moujya no yokone ni kimo tsuita</i>

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:30.170
<i>Sanmaidara Nagidara
Moujya no yokone ni kimo tsuita</i>

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.490
Is this 4th Street?

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.070
It looks like it.

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:05.480
GHOST SCHOOL

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.560
Dad, is this...?

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:10.980
Yes. It looks like the ghost school.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.150
Kitaro.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:13.650
It's okay.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:16.090
I'll disguise myself.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.920
Will that really work as a disguise?

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:27.500
Dad, there's no one here.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.450
Don't let your guard down.

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:33.550
Now pay attention.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.380
These are a frog's insides.

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:40.320
Wow! It's a moving heart!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.050
That's right, Hiroto-kun.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:47.120
You have one of these inside you
pumping blood through you every day.

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.600
Futakuchi-Onna?!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.580
But we defeated her.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.480
-I've never seen a real one before.
-Me neither.

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:55.460
I've seen one in a text book, but...

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:58.090
The teacher always does
the experiments, too.

00:07:58.090 --> 00:08:01.240
We're going to do dissecting
and experiments, too!

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:05.290
Who wants to remove the heart?

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.330
Me! Me!

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.390
Dad, everyone seems to be having fun.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:12.870
Hmm.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.170
Next problem.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:16.150
Huh?

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:18.300
It's from the next classroom.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.030
All right.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:27.660
I have here an urn that holds five liters
and an urn that holds three liters.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:34.900
Using these two, how can I accurately
measure four liters of blood?

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.070
Souma-kun?

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.070
Huh? Who, me?

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:43.120
Uh, uh. First you fill
the five-liter urn with blood, then...

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.830
Huh? I'm not sure...

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:48.010
You're on the right track.
Just a little more.

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:52.620
PRINCIPAL'S OFFICE

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:52.670
Do you want to control
your child's life like that?

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:56.800
Her teachers don't realize
just how cute Hina-chan is!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:01.070
So you told them to give her
the lead role in the school play.

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:04.320
Don't you realize you're making her
stand out in a bad way?

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.200
You give her the lead
and send her out into the world,

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:11.660
but you're not thinking what will happen
when she realizes she's not lead material!

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:13.830
Th-Then if only just for now...

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.560
Just for now?

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:20.340
It's a parent's job to think about
her future as well!

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:26.840
Dad, this is...

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:28.660
Hmm...

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:32.560
In a way, this may be education
aligned with children's curiosity.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:39.170
Are you a new student?

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:40.650
Y-Yes!

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:43.970
You can study as you like here.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:47.100
If you don't like P.E.,
you don't have to run.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:51.410
If you like books,
you can read all day long.

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.310
Does he realize?

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:54.980
It's a perfect disguise.

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:55.850
Hm?

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:58.020
N-Nothing, sir.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:00.250
What do you enjoy?

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.360
I-I just don't like school.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.740
I get it, I get it.

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:09.580
Schools will discard students
who don't fit the mold.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.510
That's right.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:16.140
Teachers tell you, "one step for a hundred
over a hundred steps for one" don't they?

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:19.130
They don't consider children
who can walk a hundred steps,

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:23.800
and children who can't walk a single step
are forced to walk.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.470
Being a ghost is good.

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:31.220
Everyone's unique. And they're free!

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:32.410
Oh?

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:36.150
Okay, it's almost dawn! Class is over!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.400
<i>That's Rat Man's voice.</i>

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.650
Oh, it's dawn. It's dawn.

00:10:57.270 --> 00:11:00.920
Why the hell do I have to do this?!

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:02.130
Rat Man.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.260
Gulp!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.630
C-Can I help you?

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.920
Huh? Who are you?

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:09.820
It's me.

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:12.260
K-Kitaro!

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:13.810
You've gotta help me!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:18.190
Tantanbo caught me.
Now I'm the ghost school handyman!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:21.400
They've got me working
from dusk till dawn!

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:25.880
After all the mischief you've pulled...
You've got some nerve.

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:28.490
Acting nervy is my specialty!

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:30.510
That wasn't a compliment.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:35.000
More importantly, how did Tantanbo
and the others come back?

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.640
Who knows?

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:40.430
They just suddenly showed up
in front of me one day.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:43.250
Dad, what's going on?

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:48.440
Well, as you know, we <i>yokai</i> don't die.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:51.360
But our bodies can be destroyed.

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:56.580
With our bodies gone,
our souls wander this world.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:12:01.060
After long months and years,
our souls regain their strength,

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:05.360
and we once again are able to have bodies.

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:09.020
But, long months and years haven't passed since

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:11.200
we defeated Tantanbo and the others.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.870
Someone must have resurrected them.

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.450
Why would anyone do that?

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.870
Let's just see what they do for now.

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:20.170
That sounds good.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:24.130
Rat Man, don't tell anyone about me.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.330
Got it.

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:34.510
All I did was ask you
if you knew where Kitaro went.

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:36.780
I didn't tell you to come with me.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.270
But, now Souma's gone, too.

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:42.290
Those brothers are complete idiots.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:47.480
Don't blame me if anything happens.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:50.050
Even Kitaro hasn't come back.

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:53.800
But you don't know the spell,
do you, Cat-san?

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:56.660
Here goes!

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:02.750
<i>Sanmaidara Nagidara
Moujya no yokone ni kimo tsuita</i>

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:07.710
<i>Sanmaidara Nagidara
Moujya no yokone ni kimo tsuita</i>

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:13.050
<i>Sanmaidara Nagidara
Moujya no yokone ni kimo tsuita!</i>

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:15.820
Oh!

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:28.170
MIAGE-NYUDO'S <i>YOKAI</i> SCHOOL

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:32.670
<i>YOKAI</i> OKAMURO

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:31.610
-<i>"Bottom's up!"</i>
-<i>"Cheers!"</i>

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:32.610
<i>"You're out!"</i>

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.700
What are we gonna do?

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:38.240
We've gathered quite a few children.

00:13:38.240 --> 00:13:41.180
Let's move on to the practical class.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.330
Practical?

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:44.060
What? What?

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:50.230
All of you are going to be <i>yokai</i> fodder!

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:52.820
-What's that?
-What?

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:55.170
<i>He's showing his true colors!</i>

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:02.280
We'll start with you kids.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:07.110
Okay!

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.230
Here we go!

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:17.990
-I wanna go home...
-Me too...

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:21.850
Oh no you don't!

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:30.270
You want to be a ghost, don't you?

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.250
Kamaitachi-sensei...

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:36.220
Your mouth is small for a ghost.

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:39.050
Let's start by slicing it open
to your ear.

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:39.990
Souma!

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:41.300
Hiroto!

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.890
We should fix your eyes, too.

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:47.500
Don't...

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.440
Cry! Scream!

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:53.780
We're making you into ghosts! Be grateful!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.750
What are you doing?!

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:02.760
I see you haven't learned your lessons.
Now you're back to make humans into <i>yokai</i>?

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.890
You're Catchick!

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:07.700
You won't get in our way!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:12.630
Hair Needles!

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:16.260
Who's there?!

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:22.660
K-Kitaro?! What are you doing here?

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:25.480
Nice going, Kitaro!
What a perfect disguise!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.660
Huh?

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:33.440
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:38.090
Kitaro!

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:43.030
Come on! Now's your chance!

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:45.950
Hiroto! Hiroto!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:47.790
Ow!

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:50.380
You're such idiots!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.130
It's dangerous here!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.940
Secret Technique
Spirit World Banishment!

00:15:57.900 --> 00:16:01.600
Have you forgotten Spirit World Banishment
doesn't work on me?!

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.280
-I'm not a fool.
-What?!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:07.310
You can stay there forever!

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:09.470
Dammit!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.230
Kitaro!

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:12.600
And now...

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:15.290
You're all that's left.

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:18.400
Cat-san!

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:21.880
Miage-Nyudo, I've seen past you!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:27.910
That's it!

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:29.830
Miage-Nyudo, I've seen--

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:31.540
Mana!

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:37.730
You're the girl we used
as a human sacrifice.

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:41.150
You can be a sacrifice again!

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:48.780
Get back here!

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:53.120
What do we do?!

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:54.940
Miage-Nyudo, I've seen--

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.420
Get back here!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.800
Ooh, how scary.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.040
Scary, scary.

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.420
Catchick!

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:24.190
Hey, Kitaro!

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:26.550
Rat Man?!

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:31.100
Cat-san!

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:34.520
Mana!

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:37.900
Souma!

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:41.670
Miage-Nyudo, I've seen past you!

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:46.990
A little further! A little further!

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:04.820
Prepare yourself, Catchick!

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.680
This is for Miage-Nyudo!

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:08.740
And for this wound!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:19.080
Are you okay, Catchick?

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:20.940
Honestly...

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:23.840
You're always late.

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:27.240
Curse you, Kitaro!

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:29.680
I hope you're prepared for this.

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:39.020
Don't back down!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:53.510
Tantanbo, I have a question for you.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:56.910
Who resurrected you guys?

00:18:57.770 --> 00:19:02.920
We were brought back by Nanashi-sama...

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:05.920
"Nameless"? Who's that?!

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:11.760
You can't win again Nanashi-sama...

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:24.520
We're back!

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:28.390
Souma, thanks for earlier.
Risking yourself to save me.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.010
It was nothing!

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:35.100
Oh, maybe as thanks you can do one of
my cram school homework assignments.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:38.270
Ow!

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:39.940
Everyone.

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:43.690
There's no need to study at school.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:47.090
But you should learn.

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:50.660
The world is full of bad grown-ups.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:54.970
Once you're taken advantage of,
it's too late to say, "I didn't know."

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:58.960
Without knowing language,
you won't recognize lies in writing.

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:02.980
Without knowing society,
you'll be deceived by society itself.

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:03.920
And...

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:07.130
Daddy Eyeball-san's lectures are long.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:08.510
Come on. Let's go.

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:11.140
...you need to learn such things.

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.550
Hold it right there!

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:15.430
You're helping, too!

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:16.700
Yes, ma'am...

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:17.770
Come on, Souma.

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:20.020
-Hey, I get it already! Ow...
-Hiroto, let's go home.

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:21.150
- I'll help!
-Yep!

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.520
Stop dragging me, my butt hurts!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.880
Shut up already!

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:27.880
Was what I said a little too difficult?

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:33.610
You can't win again Nanashi-sama...

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:38.200
Dad, who could Nanashi be?

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:41.460
Remember when you were shot with an arrow?

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:42.580
Yes.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:44.270
Since then...

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:48.380
It's been since then that <i>yokai</i> have been
increasingly doing evil against humans.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:58.280
Who are you?!

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:06.650
<i>No name, none, none
Wandering aimlessly in tears</i>

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.110
<i>Harrowed like the spots on dice</i>

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:14.050
<i>To hate one to the very end...</i>

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.830
Are you Nanashi?

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.710
<i>No name for one without a name</i>

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:24.310
<i>Nameless, nameless, so people say...</i>

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:28.060
Why did you resurrect Miage-Nyudo
and the others?!

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.570
<i>A dream ravaged!</i>

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:36.180
<i>Ravaged, ravenous, raven...</i>

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:38.820
<i>The claws of a pitch-black raven</i>

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:43.830
<i>To consume you is my pleasure!</i>

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:54.990
Nanashi...

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:58.680
As his name implies,
perhaps he has no name.

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:00.990
What is he...?

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:11.040
<i>aitsu no geta no oto ga shitanda</i>

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:11.040
<i>I heard the sound of his geta</i>

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:16.800
<i>aitsu no geta no oto ga shitanda</i>

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:16.800
<i>I heard the sound of his geta</i>

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:23.060
<i>ushiro ni iru aitsu wa dare darou</i>

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:23.060
<i>Who is that behind me?</i>

00:22:24.470 --> 00:22:28.810
<i>furimuku koto nado dekinaiyo</i>

00:22:24.470 --> 00:22:28.810
<i>I can't turn around</i>

00:22:29.810 --> 00:22:35.530
<i>mienai chikara wo mieta to omoeba</i>

00:22:29.810 --> 00:22:35.530
<i>If I believe I can see an invisible power</i>

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:39.990
<i>kesenai yami no sono mukou</i>

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:39.990
<i>Beyond that darkness that can't be erased</i>

00:22:40.780 --> 00:22:45.700
<i>aitsu no geta no oto ga shitanda</i>

00:22:40.780 --> 00:22:45.700
<i>I heard the sound of his geta</i>

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:51.500
<i>aitsu no geta no oto ga shitanda</i>

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:51.500
<i>I heard the sound of his geta</i>

00:22:53.420 --> 00:22:55.840
<i>karan koron karan koron</i>

00:22:53.420 --> 00:22:55.840
<i>Clop-clop, clop-clop</i>

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:58.800
<i>karan koron karan koron</i>

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:58.800
<i>Clop-clop, clop-clop</i>

00:22:59.130 --> 00:23:01.890
<i>karan koron karan koron</i>

00:22:59.130 --> 00:23:01.890
<i>Clop-clop, clop-clop</i>

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:08.640
<i>A beautiful flower imbibed</i>
<i>with </i>yokai<i> activity...</i>

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:12.230
<i>Dad, this flower has
some sorrowful memory?!</i>

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:15.150
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:15.280 --> 00:23:17.150
<i>"Memories of the Yoka"</i>

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:19.700
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
